{"page":105,"verses":[{"verse_key":"4:171","surah":4,"ayah":171,"ar_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَهْلَ ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ لَا تَغْلُوا۟ فِى دِينِكُمْ وَلَا تَقُولُوا۟ عَلَى ٱللَّهِ إِلَّا ٱلْحَقَّ ۚ إِنَّمَا ٱلْمَسِيحُ عِيسَى ٱبْنُ مَرْيَمَ رَسُولُ ٱللَّهِ وَكَلِمَتُهُۥٓ أَلْقَىٰهَآ إِلَىٰ مَرْيَمَ وَرُوحٌ مِّنْهُ ۖ فَـَٔامِنُوا۟ بِٱللَّهِ وَرُسُلِهِۦ ۖ وَلَا تَقُولُوا۟ ثَلَـٰثَةٌ ۚ ٱنتَهُوا۟ خَيْرًا لَّكُمْ ۚ إِنَّمَا ٱللَّهُ إِلَـٰهٌ وَٰحِدٌ ۖ سُبْحَـٰنَهُۥٓ أَن يَكُونَ لَهُۥ وَلَدٌ ۘ لَّهُۥ مَا فِى ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَمَا فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ ۗ وَكَفَىٰ بِٱللَّهِ وَكِيلًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"People of the Book, do not go to excess in your religion, and do not say anything about God except the truth: the Messiah, Jesus, son of Mary, was nothing more than a messenger of God, His word, directed to Mary, a spirit from Him. So believe in God and His messengers and do not speak of a ‘Trinity’- stop [this], that is better for you- God is only one God, He is far above having a son, everything in the heavens and earth belongs to Him and He is the best one to trust.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَهْلَ","en_gloss":"O People","transliteration":"yāahla","verse_key":"4:171"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","en_gloss":"(of) the Book","transliteration":"l-kitābi","verse_key":"4:171"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(Do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"4:171"},{"pos":4,"ar":"تَغْلُوا۟","en_gloss":"commit excess","transliteration":"taghlū","verse_key":"4:171"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"4:171"},{"pos":6,"ar":"دِينِكُمْ","en_gloss":"your religion","transliteration":"dīnikum","verse_key":"4:171"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"4:171"},{"pos":8,"ar":"تَقُولُوا۟","en_gloss":"say","transliteration":"taqūlū","verse_key":"4:171"},{"pos":9,"ar":"عَلَى","en_gloss":"about","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"4:171"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"4:17